WEBVTT

00:07:29.387 --> 00:07:31.453
as a nation and as individuals.

00:07:32.601 --> 00:07:34.668
This is not an abstract debate.

00:07:37.852 --> 00:07:39.692
A lot of us like to think

00:07:40.732 --> 00:07:44.071
if we had been back
when Hitler was rising to power,

00:07:44.095 --> 00:07:45.903
we would have been out in the street,

00:07:45.927 --> 00:07:48.641
we would have opposed him,
we would have stopped Mengele.

00:07:48.665 --> 00:07:50.331
A lot of us like to think,

00:07:51.276 --> 00:07:53.228
if we had been around during the '60s,

00:07:53.252 --> 00:07:55.355
we would have been
with the Freedom Riders.

00:07:55.379 --> 00:07:57.910
We would have been
at that bridge in Selma.

00:07:57.934 --> 00:07:59.084
Well, guess what?

00:07:59.661 --> 00:08:01.217
Here's your chance.